se": 18, "start": 143376, "end": 150722, "text": "Y dijo Jehová Dios: No es bueno que el hombre esté solo; le haré ayuda adecuada para él.", "words": [[0, 143376], [2, 143482], [7, 143762], [14, 144242], [20, 145123], [23, 145267], [26, 145467], [32, 145767], [36, 146007], [39, 146147], [46, 146367], [51, 146707], [57, 147808], [60, 147968], [65, 148208], [71, 148528], [80, 149168], [85, 149468]]}, {"verse": 19, "start": 151072, "end": 167071, "text": "Formó, pues, Jehová Dios de la tierra toda bestia del campo, y toda ave de los cielos, y las trajo a Adam, para que viese cómo les había de llamar; y todo lo que Adam llamó a los animales vivientes, ese es su nombre.", "words": [[0, 151072], [7, 151576], [13, 152436], [20, 152956], [25, 153176], [28, 153396], [31, 153516], [38, 153876], [43, 154136], [50, 154696], [54, 154836], [61, 155436], [63, 155996], [68, 156236], [72, 156636], [75, 156776], [79, 156916], [87, 157389], [89, 157863], [93, 158336], [99, 158776], [101, 158956], [107, 159316], [112, 159976], [116, 160156], [122, 160536], [127, 160816], [131, 160996], [137, 161296], [140, 161496], [148, 162305], [150, 162446], [155, 162666], [158, 162926], [162, 163086], [167, 163446], [173, 164006], [175, 164086], [179, 164226], [188, 164586], [199, 165606], [203, 165926], [206, 166226], [209, 166426]]}, {"verse": 20, "start": 167521, "end": 177915, "text": "Y puso Adam nombres a toda bestia y ave de los cielos y a todo animal del campo: mas para Adam no halló ayuda adecuada para él.", "words": [[0, 167521], [2, 167627], [7, 168067], [12, 168527], [20, 169187], [22, 169367], [27, 169527], [34, 170167], [36, 170707], [40, 170847], [43, 170967], [47, 171107], [54, 171807], [56, 172187], [58, 172287], [63, 172447], [70, 172847], [74, 173127], [81, 174202], [85, 174388], [90, 174688], [95, 175428], [98, 175708], [104, 175988], [110, 176388], [119, 177128], [124, 177368]]}, {"verse": 21, "start": 178365, "end": 189016, "text": "Y Jehová Dios hizo caer sueño sobre Adam, y se quedó dormido: entonces tomó una de sus costillas, y cerró la carne en su lugar;", "words": [[0, 178365], [2, 178490], [9, 179030], [14, 179350], [19, 179990], [24, 180490], [30, 180970], [36, 181330], [42, 181850], [44, 182430], [47, 182570], [53, 182990], [62, 183987], [71, 184729], [76, 185289], [80, 185589], [83, 185749], [87, 185929], [98, 186589], [100, 187189], [106, 187569], [109, 187709], [115, 188049], [118, 188289], [121, 188429]]}, {"verse": 22, "start": 189466, "end": 195541, "text": "Y de la costilla que Jehová Dios tomó del hombre, hizo una mujer, y la trajo al hombre.", "words": [[0, 189466], [2, 189605], [5, 189685], [8, 189805], [17, 190425], [21, 190625], [28, 191105], [33, 191305], [38, 191865], [42, 192005], [50, 192805], [55, 193085], [59, 193385], [66, 193785], [68, 194345], [71, 194465], [77, 194865], [80, 195005]]}, {"verse": 23, "start": 195991, "end": 204208, "text": "Y dijo Adam: Esto es ahora hueso de mis huesos, y carne de mi carne: esta será llamada Mujer, porque del hombre fue tomada.", "words": [[0, 195991], [2, 196159], [7, 196399], [13, 197285], [18, 197569], [21, 197769], [27, 198029], [33, 198509], [36, 198589], [40, 198709], [48, 199289], [50, 199469], [56, 199789], [59, 199969], [62, 200069], [69, 200912], [74, 201174], [79, 201434], [87, 201874], [94, 202534], [101, 202894], [105, 203094], [112, 203334], [116, 203574]]}, {"verse": 24, "start": 204558, "end": 212877, "text": "Por tanto, dejará el hombre a su padre y a su madre, y se unirá a su mujer, y serán una sola carne.", "words": [[0, 204558], [4, 204684], [11, 205204], [18, 206004], [21, 206124], [28, 206404], [30, 206564], [33, 206684], [39, 207044], [41, 207384], [43, 207484], [46, 207624], [53, 207944], [55, 208724], [58, 208904], [64, 209604], [66, 209804], [69, 209984], [76, 210424], [78, 211244], [84, 211664], [88, 211864], [93, 212124]]}, {"verse": 25, "start": 213327, "end": 218120, "text": "Y estaban ambos desnudos, Adam y su mujer, y no se avergonzaban.", "wo